### Generate Custom Migration and Create pgvector Extension

Source: https://github.com/drizzle-team/drizzle-orm-docs/blob/main/src/content/docs/guides/vector-similarity-search.mdx

Use Drizzle Kit to generate a custom migration file, then add the SQL query to enable the `pgvector` extension in PostgreSQL.

```bash
npx drizzle-kit generate --custom
```

```sql
CREATE EXTENSION vector;
```

